    "workshopOrigin": "slides",
    "searchText": "Developing an expectation \nPlanning for year ending 31 December 20X4\n• A new contract was won commencing 1 April 20X4 which will increase monthly revenues by 20% \non 20X3\n• A key product, accounting for 7% of 20X3 revenue was discontinued from 1 January 20X4\n• Average head count for 20X3 was 70 staff; for 20X4 this is 80 staff\n• All staff received a 4% pay increase at the start of the year.\n• In addition to the 80 staff above, a new director has been employed from 1 July 20X4 on a salary \nof £120k per annum\nICAS AA Workshop 2\n23\nActual 20X3 \nTotal Revenue\n£4,750,000\nTotal Payroll\n£2,135,000\nDeveloping an expectation \nPlanning for year ending 31 December 20X4\nRevenue expectation\nWhat do you expect total revenue for the year ending 31 December 20X4 to be, based on the \ninformation given?\nA) £5,225,000\nB) £5,462,500\nC) £5,130,000\nD) £4,750,000\n \nICAS AA Workshop 2\n24\n",
